    "name": "Dev Chand",
    "timeline": "AD 1251-1269",
    "image": "data/5/5.png",
    "audioHindi": "data/5/hindi.mp3",
    "audioEng": "data/5/eng.mp3",
    "hindiText": "देव चंद अपने पिता मेघ चंद का उत्तराधिकारी बना, जिनके बाद आलम चंद (1269–1302) गद्दी पर आए।",
    "englishText": "Dev Chand succeeded his father, Megh Chand, who was followed by Alam Chand (1269-1302)."
